WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.610
♪♪

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:20.619
♪♪

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:22.355
-Hey, everybody.
How you doing tonight?

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.090
Yeah, me too.
This sucks.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.925
What are you gonna do about it?
Hey, I know.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:29.195
Let's do a monologue
without an audience.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.863
Senate Majority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.665
and Senate Minority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.567
announced today
they had reached a deal

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.636
on a coronavirus
economic stimulus package.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:40.806
Unfortunately, they shook on it
and are now in quarantine.

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:42.975
The White House
and Senate leaders

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:44.544
struck a deal this morning

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.413
over a $2 trillion
coronavirus stimulus package,

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:49.982
$1.9 trillion
to bail out cruise lines

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:53.819
plus a dozen surgical masks
for New York City.

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:56.922
President Trump's White House
doctor announced last week

00:00:56.922 --> 00:00:59.792
that Trump had tested negative
for the coronavirus,

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:03.029
which means Trump has still
never passed a single test

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.397
in his life.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.666
[ As Donald Trump ]
Maybe cholesterol?

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.768
Can we line me up
for one of those?

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:11.404
[ Normal voice ] That's right --
The White House doctor announced

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.739
that President Trump had tested
negative for coronavirus,

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:17.643
though he did have something
called McRib lung.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.078
Democratic Party officials

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:21.981
are reportedly considering
a range of contingency plans

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:24.550
for their upcoming
national convention in July,

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.852
including hosting
a "virtual convention."

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:28.220
Oh, God.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.590
Please don't make Joe Biden
learn Skype.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:33.159
[ As Joe Biden ] "Www"?
That's not even a word.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:37.931
Back in my day, we had a little
something called vowels, buster.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.765
[ Normal voice ]
Not a good Biden.

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:41.935
Despite administration officials
cautioning

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.302
that it's too early to tell

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:45.805
if an anti-malarial drug
will cure the coronavirus,

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:49.341
President Trump told reporters,
"I feel good about it.

00:01:49.341 --> 00:01:51.744
Just a feeling.
I am a smart guy."

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.314
So we don't know if
the malaria drug will work,

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:56.682
but whatever drug Trump is on
works great.

00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:58.717
A New York strip club
has launched

00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:01.821
virtual-reality lap dances
for patrons to stream at home.

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:03.689
Or if you don't have VR goggles,

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:07.260
you can just burn a $100 bill
while you listen to Whitesnake.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.362
Yesterday was
National Cocktail Day,

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.964
said Americans at 9:00 a.m.

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:14.867
According to reports, disgraced
movie mogul Harvey Weinstein

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:17.370
has tested positive
for the coronavirus in prison.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:21.307
So for once, he's the one
who can say, "Me too."

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:22.942
That's right -- Harvey Weinstein

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.511
has tested positive
for the coronavirus in prison,

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:28.414
so if you've been in close
contact with Harvey Weinstein,

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:31.683
I have even more bad news.

00:02:31.683 --> 00:02:34.486
A woman in New Mexico
was arrested over the weekend

00:02:34.486 --> 00:02:37.490
for stealing a car and telling
officers she was Beyoncé.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:41.094
But in her defense,
she only said she was Beyoncé

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.863
so she could get
a coronavirus test.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.232
According to reports,
divorce lawyers in Manhattan

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.067
have experienced
an increase in calls

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.769
due to the coronavirus
quarantine.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:52.472
And if you're wondering why
they're open during a pandemic,

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:56.375
in New York, divorce
is an essential business.

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:59.011
A man in New Hampshire
was arrested on Monday

00:02:59.011 --> 00:03:02.581
after he allegedly chased a
neighbor with a 2 1/2-foot sword

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:05.317
because he asked him
to turn down his music.

00:03:05.317 --> 00:03:06.786
Dude, are you crazy?

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:10.455
That sword has to be
at least six feet.

00:03:10.455 --> 00:03:12.491
You're vector, buddy.

00:03:12.491 --> 00:03:16.028
Organizers of the National High
School Musical Theatre Awards

00:03:16.028 --> 00:03:19.031
have announced that due to
the coronavirus pandemic,

00:03:19.031 --> 00:03:21.434
this year's competition
has been canceled

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:22.969
because it's too depressing

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:25.204
to hear the kids
from "A Chorus Line"

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:26.839
sing, "God, I hope I get it."

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.674
Matt Goldich wrote that joke.

00:03:28.674 --> 00:03:31.811
You can follow him on Twitter
and complain.

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:33.479
That's right --
the National High School

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.247
Musical Theatre Awards
have been canceled,

00:03:35.247 --> 00:03:40.520
and they want to remind everyone
to wash your...hands!

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:44.390
And finally, a woman in Missouri
recently gave birth last week

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.026
in the toilet paper aisle
of a Walmart.

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:51.264
Said the woman, "That means
I can get two rolls, right?"

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:53.232
Hey, everybody,
that was a monologue.

00:03:53.232 --> 00:03:55.668
And we're just
trying it out here.

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:57.169
We got a new microphone.

00:03:57.169 --> 00:03:59.205
So maybe this sounds
a little bit better.

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:02.608
I think our lighting's
a little bit better.

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:04.210
I can hear a lawn mower,

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.646
so maybe you've been able to
this whole time, as well.

00:04:07.646 --> 00:04:09.882
Wash your hands.
Stay safe.

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:11.985
We love you.
Thanks for watching.

